{"4230080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rise of Mutant Swarms", "steam_appid": 4230080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/73e3c3bf3533ccd62718294a72523874.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/73e3c3bf3533ccd62718294a72523874.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/73e3c3bf3533ccd62718294a72523874.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Mutant Swarms</i> is a strategy survival game where every decision determines how long you last. Players must plan their defenses, deploy turrets, and adapt to relentless waves of mutant enemies that grow stronger with each attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with planning your defense. Place turrets carefully on unique maps where positioning and coverage matter most. Smart placement is the key to surviving the waves ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/9fb5e79a85b4ad9cc69b9caa713f60fc.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/9fb5e79a85b4ad9cc69b9caa713f60fc.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/9fb5e79a85b4ad9cc69b9caa713f60fc.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold the Line</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against waves of mutant enemies, each with distinct behaviors like regeneration, flight, or splitting. Enemies evolve over time, demanding constant adaptation and smarter defensive setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/ae43a0caebfc433874a48f26ed38f2be.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/ae43a0caebfc433874a48f26ed38f2be.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/ae43a0caebfc433874a48f26ed38f2be.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim Your Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving waves earns coins, supplies, and crystals. These rewards fuel your next decisions whether it’s strengthening your defenses mid-run or preparing for future battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/0104496da6b9d1566f200c0d5ab86788.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/0104496da6b9d1566f200c0d5ab86788.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/0104496da6b9d1566f200c0d5ab86788.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen Your Arsenal </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade turrets during combat for short-term power boosts, and unlock permanent upgrades outside gameplay to improve towers, shields, and systems. After major waves, choose reward cards that shape your build and long-term strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/6c23c17f76da124851ba4f9612092bf7.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/6c23c17f76da124851ba4f9612092bf7.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/6c23c17f76da124851ba4f9612092bf7.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Swarm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run tests how long you can last as waves grow more brutal. A shielded base system offers a final layer of protection, but survival depends on smart decisions, efficient upgrades, and mastering the evolving battlefield.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/73e3c3bf3533ccd62718294a72523874.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/73e3c3bf3533ccd62718294a72523874.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/73e3c3bf3533ccd62718294a72523874.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rise of Mutant Swarms</i> is a strategy survival game where every decision determines how long you last. Players must plan their defenses, deploy turrets, and adapt to relentless waves of mutant enemies that grow stronger with each attack.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with planning your defense. Place turrets carefully on unique maps where positioning and coverage matter most. Smart placement is the key to surviving the waves ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/9fb5e79a85b4ad9cc69b9caa713f60fc.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/9fb5e79a85b4ad9cc69b9caa713f60fc.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/9fb5e79a85b4ad9cc69b9caa713f60fc.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hold the Line</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against waves of mutant enemies, each with distinct behaviors like regeneration, flight, or splitting. Enemies evolve over time, demanding constant adaptation and smarter defensive setups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/ae43a0caebfc433874a48f26ed38f2be.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/ae43a0caebfc433874a48f26ed38f2be.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/ae43a0caebfc433874a48f26ed38f2be.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Claim Your Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surviving waves earns coins, supplies, and crystals. These rewards fuel your next decisions whether it’s strengthening your defenses mid-run or preparing for future battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/0104496da6b9d1566f200c0d5ab86788.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/0104496da6b9d1566f200c0d5ab86788.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/0104496da6b9d1566f200c0d5ab86788.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strengthen Your Arsenal </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade turrets during combat for short-term power boosts, and unlock permanent upgrades outside gameplay to improve towers, shields, and systems. After major waves, choose reward cards that shape your build and long-term strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/6c23c17f76da124851ba4f9612092bf7.poster.avif?t=1787749165\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/6c23c17f76da124851ba4f9612092bf7.webm?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/extras/6c23c17f76da124851ba4f9612092bf7.mp4?t=1787749165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Swarm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run tests how long you can last as waves grow more brutal. A shielded base system offers a final layer of protection, but survival depends on smart decisions, efficient upgrades, and mastering the evolving battlefield.</p>", "short_description": "Rise of Mutant Swarms is a strategy survival tower-defense game where you defend the base against waves of evolving mutant enemies. Place and upgrade turrets, adapt to enemy abilities, and make critical decisions as the pressure rises with every wave.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/de03053a071ad6fe2a9f7fe795651132142fa989/header.jpg?t=1787749165", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/5abf1bc9b7012f58b147f1544333475500dcca3a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787749165", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4230080/5abf1bc9b7012f58b147f1544333475500dcca3a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787749165", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong